# F11-13 lab input: attack tree for the home robot of the story hook.
# Two spaces of indentation per level. LEAF <effort points> <step>.
# Effort points are the modeller's relative guesses for this exercise.
OR Make the robot move without its owner's permission
  AND Drive it through the Wi-Fi command port
    LEAF 3 Join the home Wi-Fi network
    LEAF 2 Find the robot's command port
    LEAF 1 Send a drive message
  AND Drive it with its own buttons
    LEAF 6 Get into the house
    LEAF 1 Press the buttons on the robot
  AND Replace the robot's program
    LEAF 6 Get into the house
    LEAF 4 Open the case and reach the service port
    LEAF 5 Write a new program and load it
MITIGATE 6 Join the home Wi-Fi network | separate network for the robot with its own long password
MITIGATE 8 Send a drive message | drive messages must carry a valid message code (F11-15)
MITIGATE 7 Open the case and reach the service port | service port disabled in the shipped build (SS301)
